WEBVTT

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.610
Listen... Listen up, Senpai?

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.340
Senpai, you've lost your powers as the Progenitor.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.250
Because you're just an ordinary human now.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.050
Don't do anything reckless like jump out of here.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.820
Absolutely not! okay?

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.300
I know.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:21.020
Also, Senpai, you're down below me,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.570
so you can't look up...

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.440
Please Look!

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.430
No... not me, the sky!

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.360
The sky?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.030
The Land of Node is disappearing.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.940
It seems that the gate to
the Node can only appear at night.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.690
That means we can't track MAR until night?

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.250
Anyway, we leave the Keystone Gate first.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.360
Senpai, you should take a rest.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:55.280
Yeah, but it'd be nice if we could go out smoothly.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:34.860
Those guys are the ones who
participated in the Lord's War, right?

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.320
Yes, probably.

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:39.280
Then why did they attack this place now?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:44.240
I think it's because they discovered
MAR behind Order the End.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.530
Yuuma-san?

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.420
Thank goodness! You're safe, Yuuma!

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:52.410
Yup and you too.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.420
I get it. Let's see.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:04.440
Wait... Yuuma-san! What are
you doing to Akatsuki-senpai?

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:08.940
Oh no... I want to see if there
was the vampiric impulse occurs.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.280
But it looks like Kojou is really not a vampire.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.730
How did you know?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.880
Because while you were fighting.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:22.600
I'm an attack mage at the Gigafloat
Management Corporation as spy.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.370
That's why I know this.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.600
It's like this?

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:29.960
Hey, Kojou, would you take
her back from the land of Node?

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.040
So I have a message from the
Gigafloat Management Corporation.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.750
<i>" Unfortunately, we want you to give up. "</i>

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.420
"We can't let you do that as
ordinary person who is not related."

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.890
Unrelated people?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.180
But... I... must get Avrora back!

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.470
I understand how you feel.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:53.310
But you became an ordinary
human without any power.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.660
What can you do when you go to the Node?

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:02.240
Yup, you really are better as a human.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.400
You look good under the sun.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:05.390
Yuuma.

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.330
See ya.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.000
Bye bye, Kojou.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.390
Take care of the ordinary life that you have obtained.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.200
Yuuma-san!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.820
Himeragi-san, I'm counting on you for Kojou.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.900
Stop it, Yuuma!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:25.200
It's over. I got Kojou out of here.

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:28.270
<i>Good job, an assistant attack mage officer, Tokoyogi.</i>

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:30.620
Is this the end of his role?

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:33.850
<i>Now, Akatsuki Kojou is just a powerless high school student.</i>

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.240
<i>There is no need to expect any more role for him.</i>

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:42.990
But for me, Kojou still seems to
be in the center of the situation.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.920
And also at  the center of extraordinary problems.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.240
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.810
It's just a hunch, but...

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.600
The witch's hunch is often right.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.340
Here is...?

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.470
It's at the front entrance to the Saikai Academy, isn't it?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.380
Damn it... What are you thinking, Yuuma?!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.920
Ouch!

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.500
Please show me, Senpai is no longer a vampire.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.830
If you hit something like this, you will surely be hurt.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.890
Please be more careful.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:22.480
Because the current you will
surely die if you are badly hurt.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:26.960
It'll be bad if your neck is cut off
or the whole body is stabbed.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.860
No, it's not like I'm injured because I wanted to.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.360
Yukki...

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.850
Yuiri-san?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.830
Yukki!

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:43.740
Yukki, I'm sorry...  sorry... I... I...

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.820
Eh! Wait...

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:50.560
Please stand up, Yuiri-san. You don't have to apologize.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.570
W- What？What's going on?

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:56.810
Hey, calm down, Yuiri!
You're making Himeragi uncomfortable.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.480
I couldn't leave them in the
domain of the Second Progenitor.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.910
So l brought them here first.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.600
Seems like it's becoming the problem.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.610
Yaze...

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.530
Ko, Kojou-kun, I'm sorry...

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:13.450
I was suddenly attacked Yukki... and then.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.920
Calm down, Yuiri-san. It's alright, so it's okay.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.930
What the heck is going on?

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:24.050
The Demon District Research Department
[ Mazoku tokku kenkyuu bu ]

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.010
Did you transfer the power of the Fourth Progenitor?
The Demon District Research Department
[ Mazoku tokku kenkyuu bu ]

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.390
Did you transfer the power of the Fourth Progenitor?

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:32.960
Ah, in that case, to be precise,
it's returned to the original owner.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.960
Hmm?  So that's it. Hey...

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:39.360
" Hey"?  Isn't this a big deal?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.890
How can you be so calm?

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.940
Because in us opinion.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:47.800
It has been about half a year since
Kojou became the fourth Progenitor.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.880
I only found out recently.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:56.040
So well, it doesn't matter how Kojou is?

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:00.090
But the problem is Avrora-chan, who is in the node.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:04.080
Hey Kojou, how do you plan to save her?

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:11.070
Hey, Asagi. Could you access the
Keystone Gate to control Node's Gate?

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:16.460
I'm just programming as a hobby
but I don't know anything about magic.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.500
Let's say that we can control the gate.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.210
What are you going to do in the Node?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.110
Are you going to start a war with MAR's special forces?

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.280
I've thought about it.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.160
Can you use your "the cleansing"
to turn me back into a vampire?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.040
Kojou-kun.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:38.520
Well, the original cleansing that Cain used.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:41.920
It seems transformed all the
Tenbu in the world into demons.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:45.420
If conditions are met and it's just Kojou, probably...

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:46.490
Can you do it?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.520
But there is still a problem.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.890
There's something I can't do.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.100
How do you plan to use the Familiars?

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:58.940
The one thing cleansing can transform is your body,

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.940
but not prepare the Familiars for you.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:04.770
You're right, the Familiars... The Familiars?

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:09.500
One more thing, I'd like to hear your answer anyway.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:10.670
What?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:14.660
Why do you want to do that to save Avrora-san?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:18.360
It's obvious. Because she sacrificed herself for me.

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:19.980
Do you love that girl?

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:23.960
What? Wait a minute.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.810
Why do you ask such a question?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.120
What do you mean "the love"?

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.880
Ah, really, you're so indecisive, This coward!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.880
I'm asking if you're in love with her!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:37.470
Do you want Himeragi-san and I to help
you bring back the girl you love ?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.290
What are you talking about?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.440
Do I love Avrora or not?

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:43.210
What does Asagi have to do with this?

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:45.290
You an idiot, Kojou! You!

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.900
This guy... I'm leaving!

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.480
What did she all of a sudden?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.060
What?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:03.710
Senpai, you don't know why Aiba-senpai is mad?

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.670
You really don't know anything at all, do you?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.810
No, obviously, when I think about it.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.990
It's no surprise that she will be angry.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.640
Eh? Don't tell me, you already know?

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.630
Well, it's already like this.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.150
She must manage the consequences of
the Lord's War and the restoration of the island.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.680
And now she's also too busy.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:29.280
While I don't help and focus only on about Avrora.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.900
It can't be helped if she get angry.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:32.980
Huh?

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:37.880
Um... senpai, do you mean that seriously?

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:42.980
Did you think Aiba-senpai angry
because you're focused only on Avrora-san?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.890
Huh? Isn't it? Then why was she angry?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.320
I don't think she was jealousy.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:51.870
Instead, why don't you think she was jealousy?

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:55.860
Because the positions of Asagi and
Avrora are completely different, isn't it ?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.900
Avrora, she's like a part of me.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.630
It's like a sister who shared blood.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:06.580
So you don't like her?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.560
That... I want to say, in the sense of love...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:20.280
I've only bits and pieces of
memories from the time I was with her.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.600
To be honest, I'm not sure.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:30.120
But I still think she's like a sister to be cared for.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:38.660
Let me explain first, I also know
that's reckless to go to the Node.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:42.860
It's okay if anyone other than me can save her.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.100
I think you don't need to be pessimistic about that.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.500
MAR wouldn't pass up an opportunity
to take advantage of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.160
This will certainly pose a threat to humanity.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:56.720
So there should be a lot of people
trying to take Avrora-san from the chief Ren.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.740
But in that case...

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:05.700
Is it more likely to be destroyed than to save Avrora?

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:06.800
Yes!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.960
I am so... helpless.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.720
It will be alright.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.380
Himeragi...

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.940
Anyway, let's rest now.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.050
If you're too tired, you can't come up with a good idea.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.850
The current senpai is not immortal.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.350
It's best if you keep your physical strength.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.350
Really. You are right.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.180
Yes.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.280
What's up, Himeragi?

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.380
I feel like there's someone in the senpai's house

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.580
Oh, Yukina-chan and Kojou-kun, welcome home!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:53.340
Nagisa. Is it really you?

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:57.800
Kojou-kun, what's wrong ?! You're overreacting.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.980
Rather, Isn't the atmosphere changed?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.580
Don't worry. It's okay.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:08.360
Because I have a reliable bodyguard come with me.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:09.680
Bodyguard?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.580
Yo, the boy. We met again.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.020
Here you go, enjoy the taste!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.160
Then I'll give the rest to the others

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.160
See you later, Yukina-chan!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.170
Don't worry about your sister.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:39.840
The old lady of Chaos Realm has no
reason to do anything to that child now.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.060
In case, she got Aladar as an escort.

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.920
Why are you doing so much for Nagisa?

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.780
Because that child is so cute and I love her so much!

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:53.140
Oh, it's delicious! You don't hesitate to eat it.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:56.180
How come you're more relaxed than I am.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.960
First of all, let's say thank you

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.700
Good work on the ghost extermination.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:04.320
Do you mean the Blood as the Ghost?

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.740
That's right. And that guy is also,

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:10.380
It was his longtime wish to end
with the true Fourth Progenitor, right?

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:14.080
In that case, why did Zana-san get in the way of us?

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:19.840
Because I wanted to fight with
the cute girls like your girlfriends.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.000
There are other important things to do.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:22.980
Things to do?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:26.260
Do you want to save Dodekatos?

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.100
Yeah!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.820
Then, I'll help you. Let's make a deal.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.940
A deal?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.040
With me, who is just an ordinary human?

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:39.240
We want to prevent the threat of
the Node's land to the this world.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:43.100
It's not only MAR, but also all countries and
forces that want to take advantage of it.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:47.480
In the worst case, you can
completely destroy the Node.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.500
Why give this task to Senpai?

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:52.200
Just order your subordinates should be fine.

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:55.780
If I can do it. I'll take care of it myself.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:59.640
But there are reasons why I can't do this.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.980
Because we can't use the Familiars in the Node.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.940
The Familiars are originally
summoned from another world.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:13.020
And in the Node, vampires themselves
are unstable foreign objects from another world.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:17.500
So, it's impossible to summon unstable the Familiars

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.190
With one exception.

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.540
An exception...

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.220
It can't be! Do you mean the Fourth Progenitor?

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.400
Exactly.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:31.830
The Fourth Progenitor was the weapon
created to destroy the Sinful God, Cain.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.900
The power of the Familiars can be used in the Node,

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.410
which was created for this purpose.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:41.280
Is that why Shafriar Ren took Avrora?

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:46.360
Yeah, that rich bastard is a descendant
of "<i>Tenbu</i>" even if he's crooked.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.240
In the Node where you can't summon the familiars.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.820
Only he can use the magic of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:55.380
Can you imagine how dangerous that is?

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:00.640
If I go into the Node...
Can I do something about that situation?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.380
I can't guarantee, but I'll give you a chance.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.070
I got it. I'll do it.

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.080
Senpai?

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:13.800
The answer is straightforward, not bad.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.760
However, there is one condition of this contract.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:20.060
There should be the spirit medium that dedicates destiny to you.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.170
In other words, there must be the blood companion.

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.560
At least 12 people.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.220
12 people?!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:27.300
What?

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:28.760
Can you do it?

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:32.180
No, it's absolutely impossible!
That ridiculous the number of people!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.720
I see. Unfortunately, a boy.

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.440
I like you quite a lot.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.150
Sorry.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.260
Za... Zana-san, what are you doing?!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:55.660
Why did you do this?

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:13.180
Lie, crap! This girl can be a bit
dangerous when she gets angry!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.920
Ouch, ouch...

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:19.900
Idiot, It's too much to put your tongue in.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:24.180
Don't trample on the pure hearts of adolescent boys.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:29.200
But at least I wanted him to have
some nice memories at the end.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.400
Senpai! Hang in there! Senpai!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.040
The wound... Why?

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.560
I gave the boy to eat the Familiars.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:44.880
Didn't I told you, that I'll give you a chance?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:49.700
You gain the power of a vampire by eating the Familiars.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.010
We called it the cannibalism with family.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:57.520
But now, Senpai is just an ordinary
human, it's impossible to do that.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:58.850
Um...?

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.060
When did he become an ordinary human?

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:07.160
What Akatsuki Kojou gave up only
control of the Fourth Progenitor's familiars.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.960
The immortal curse engraved by the Gods.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.520
It should still be in his body even now.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.660
However,  the Familiars I gave you.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.240
It has the same power as the 12
Familiars of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.200
Whether you can tame them is another matter.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.500
The familiars as strong as the Fourth Progenitor?

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.880
Where the hack did you get that?

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.340
I see.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.240
When I was fighting the Blood.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.920
You appeared at Keystone Gate.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.960
So it was to get the Blood's familiars, right?

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.820
Correct.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:46.680
I have temporarily preserved the Familiars
of Kenon that was about to disappear.

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.960
You can thank me for that.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:52.100
Before you will no longer be you.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:53.780
What do you mean?

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:57.580
You're not much different from ordinary humans now .

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:01.740
Do you have a power to tame the twelve Familiars?

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.820
You said that you need the twelve blood companions.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.020
Is that for the Familiar control?

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.780
One Familiar per One person.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.200
If there are 12 spirit mediums on the same level as you.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.240
It might be possible to tame the Familiars, isn't it?

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.860
Isn't that right, a young lady Sword Shaman?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.930
I will give you this.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.360
Alchemy?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:31.360
It is the catalyst for sealing from the
flesh and bone fragments of Akatsuki Kojou.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.720
It should be the same material as your ring.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.640
If you are an advanced alchemist,
you can change the shape any way you want.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.880
Make it as cute as you can.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:44.330
If you can't collect the blood companion, that's fine.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:48.540
If your Familiars run rampant,
this island will be wiped out.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:51.250
The gate will disappear and everything will be over.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.380
It's a little boring. Well, it can't be helped.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.130
I won't let them do anything on this island.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:02.100
Your part is over.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.860
As promised.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:08.360
Just stand aside and watch me get that bastard Shafriar Ren out of the Node.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:12.540
This is what I expected from you, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.530
Try as hard as you can, I'll be hoping to see you again.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.200
Is it really okay if you don't sleep?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.660
I don't know when the Familiars will run rampant.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:27.660
I can't sleep in the middle of a residential area anyway.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.160
How is your physical condition?

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:32.840
As expected, I can't say I am in perfect condition.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:38.300
To be honest, I don't even know why I'm still alive.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:45.060
Um, senpai, please come with me.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.020
What do you think?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:59.740
How? Oh, yes... Well, I think
it's cute. Looks like it suits you?

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:04.990
I don't mean the bra!
I'm talking about you can suck my blood.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:09.300
W- What's wrong?

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.020
Do you mean I'm not enough to your vampiric urges?

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.800
No, it's not like that... Look.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.660
Because my body right now is
a human rather than a vampire.

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:23.730
I don't have the urge to suck blood.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:28.900
Oh! Why did I do such embarrassing thing?

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.260
It's strange...

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:32.700
As I thought, my underwear doesn't fit me, right?

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.360
No, I'm meaning the blood companions.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:39.360
I can't suck blood now, how
can I get the twelve people together?

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:44.720
Is it possible that the First Progenitor
didn't expect this situation?

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.560
It's impossible for that guy.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.040
Senpai?

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:56.170
Himeragi, the spear! Take it out, hurry up!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.660
The magic power of the Familiar is... affecting his body?

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:07.520
Himeragi, kill me along with the Familiar!

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:11.020
If these guys run rampant, this island will really disappear!

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.140
W-What are you talking about?

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.680
I can't do something like that?

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.560
Please, there is no time!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.920
I can't suppress these guys anymore...  !

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.180
I'm going to stop the Senpai's Familiars!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.940
I'll use Sekkarou's the divine
vibration wave to create a barrier.

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:36.840
Stop it, Himeragi! Do you want to bear
the spiritual power of 12 people alone?

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:40.360
If you do that, you'll disappear first!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:43.340
If Senpai die, what about Avrora-san?

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:46.340
Don't you want to bring her back?

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:51.160
Don't worry, I won't become an angel so easily.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.200
I'm not a good person as you might think.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:01.730
Himeragi, run away!

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.160
Richel Carle, Type 6.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.280
Just kidding!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:10.280
Kisaki-san!

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:13.320
It seems there's interesting stuff going on here.

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:15.320
Could you explain the situation to me?

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:19.520
What happened to Akatsuki Kojou?

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:25.420
I heard that he gave up the power of the
fourth Progenitor and became an ordinary person.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.120
Zana-san.

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:30.850
The blood companion of the First
Progenitor transplanted the Familiars to him.

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:33.270
How did she do that?

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:37.460
That's ... that ... It should be saying " an oral intake".

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:39.900
I see.

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:46.220
You're excited to see Akatsuki Kojou's lips be
taken away in front of your eyes, aren't you?

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:48.030
I- I wasn't excited!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.060
Let it be for your special disposition.

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:53.330
What will we do with that man?

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:59.540
The First Progenitor said, if there are enough
the blood companions to control the Familiars.

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:03.380
In the worst case, I have to stop the
run rampant of the Familiars on my own.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:05.970
The Blood companion... right?

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:11.280
K-Kisaki-san, what are you doing at this time?

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:13.500
That's why I took it off at a time like this.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:16.600
Seduce him with beauty and let him suck blood.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:19.480
Isn't that what you've been doing?

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:25.360
Come on, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:31.780
Please run away! Now Senpai
don't have the vampiric impulses.

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:35.920
What the hell is that?

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:37.540
It's the Familiars of The Blood.

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:42.750
I see. This is the power given to him
by the First Progenitor are these guys.

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:49.800
This is bad!

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:56.240
The Lion King organization?!

00:23:56.350 --> 00:23:57.430
Sayaka-san!

00:23:57.770 --> 00:24:00.400
Are you safe, Yukina? Thank goodness!

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:03.160
By the way, why are you dressed like that?

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.520
Kisaki Kiriha!

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.340
Huh?！What kind of attitude is that?

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:10.420
I saved you when I helped Yukina!

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:13.500
Good grief, it looks like we're finally catching up.

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:18.370
Thank you, Witch of the Void.

00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:20.620
Shike-sama and Minamiya-sensei too.

00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:26.300
While I take my eyes off a little, it
seems that idiot has become trouble again.

00:24:26.670 --> 00:24:32.420
Minamiya-sensei, can you temporarily
isolate Akatsuki-senpai to the prison barrier?

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:33.840
It's impossible.

00:24:33.840 --> 00:24:38.760
You already know that I can't take
the Familiars to the prison barrier.

00:24:38.760 --> 00:24:43.940
Even if I drag Akatsuki Kojou into the
prison, that Familiar will remain in this world.

00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:51.570
Nevertheless, it's impossible to
suppress these Familiars with force.

00:24:51.860 --> 00:24:55.080
If it's one or two, it would have been manageable.

00:24:55.080 --> 00:24:58.420
But if the number continues to increase,
Itogami Island will not be able to maintain.

00:25:00.140 --> 00:25:01.740
Sayaka-san!
